n, RV. x; AV.; ŚBr. viii; MBh. v, 1224; Ragh. i, 11", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "the sacred text of the Vedic hymns, ŚBr. xi, 5, 7, 3; ĀśvGṛ.; Kauś.; Gobh.; VPrāt.; Pāṇ.; Mn. &c.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "metre (in general, supposed to consist of 3 or 7 typical forms [AV.; VS. &c.] to which Virāj is added as the 8th [ŚBr. viii, 3, 3, 6]; छ॑न्दस् opposed to गायत्रि॑ and त्रिष्टु॑भ्, RV. x, 14, 16)", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "metrical science, MuṇḍUp. i, 1, 5; MBh. i, 2887; Pañcat.; Śrut.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "= ˚दो-ग्रन्थ, Nyāyam. ix, 2, 6, Sch.;", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "छन्दस् [cf. Lat. scando, ‘to step, scan’.]", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "छन्˚दस् &c. See ib.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["छंदस्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["CaMdas"]}, {"id": "CandaS", "headword": "छन्दश्", "headword_slp1": "CandaS", "fold": "Candas", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "छन्दश् = ˚दस्.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "Cana": [{"id": "Canna", "headword": "छन्न", "headword_slp1": "Canna", "fold": "Cana", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "छन्न mfn. covered, covered over, MBh. iii, 800; R. i f.; Megh.; BhP. &c. (ifc. cf. Pāṇ. vi, 2, 170)", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "obscured (the moon), MBh. i, 2699; Sūryas. iv, 10 and 22", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "hidden, unnoticed by (dat.), secret, clandestine, disguised, MBh. iii f.; R. ii, v; BhP.; Kathās.; Rājat.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "छन्न ind. (in comp. ˚न्न-), Rājat. v, 467", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "छन्न ind. (with √ गै, to sing) privately, in a low voice, Lāṭy. iii, 1, 12 ff.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "छन्न See √ 1. छद्.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["छन्नं", "छन्नः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["CannaM", "CannaH"]}], "Canam": [{"id": "Cannam", "headword": "छन्नम्", "headword_slp1": "Cannam", "fold": "Canam", "headword_language": "sa", "sour