.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["छन्दपातनः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["CandapAtanaH"]}], "Candaprasasti": [{"id": "CandapraSasti", "headword": "छन्दप्रशस्ति", "headword_slp1": "CandapraSasti", "fold": "Candaprasasti", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "छन्द—प्रशस्ति f. N. of wk. by Harṣa.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "Candamftyu": [{"id": "Candamftyu", "headword": "छन्दमृत्यु", "headword_slp1": "Candamftyu", "fold": "Candamftyu", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "छन्द—मृत्यु mfn. having death in one's power, MBh. xii, 1820; BhP. i, 9, 29.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "Candahanis": [{"id": "CandahAnis", "headword": "छन्दहानिस्", "headword_slp1": "CandahAnis", "fold": "Candahanis", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "छन्द—हानिस् mfn. giving up one's desires (?), Divyāv. xxxv, 173.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "Candanugamin": [{"id": "CandAnugAmin", "headword": "छन्दानुगामिन्", "headword_slp1": "CandAnugAmin", "fold": "Candanugamin", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "छन्दानुगामिन् mfn. complying with the wishes (of others), submissive, Cāṇ.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "Candanuvartin": [{"id": "CandAnuvartin", "headword": "छन्दानुवर्तिन्", "headword_slp1": "CandAnuvartin", "fold": "Candanuvartin", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "छन्दानुवर्तिन् mfn. id., MBh. iii, 296; R. ii, 53, 10; Pañcat.; Kām.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "following one's own will, Rājat. iii, 141.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["छन्दानुवर्त्तिन्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["CandAnuvarttin"]}], "Candanuvfta": [{"id": "CandAnuvftta", "headword": "छन्दानुवृत्त", "headword_slp1": "CandAnuvftta", "fold": "Candanuvfta", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "छन्दानुवृत्त v.l. for ˚दो-ऽनुव्˚.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "Candaka": [{"id": "Candaka", "headword"